  "limitations": [
    "The central plan, position and alignment use the mapped cistern, nearby street axes and the published plan. Exact buried thresholds, floor elevation and the two stair enclosures are approximate.",
    "The post-restoration steel walkways and lighting are reconstructed from public views. The Medusa reliefs are original modeled interpretations. Rotating exhibitions and the variable lighting show are omitted. The World Viewer fixture reviews interior rendering from explicit inside cameras. Standard interactive underground navigation remains unverified."
  ],
